enabling throughput of $\sim$2,000 patches/minute with batch processing.
/scratch/gdemil24/CVPR_sentinel_Fusion/ISPR_Paper_latex/sec/6_Conclusion.tex:14:    \item \textbf{Multi-Season and Multi-Region Validation.} Expanding evaluation beyond northern Finland (July--October 2025) to encompass diverse geographic regions (mid-latitudes, forested environments, arid zones), seasonal conditions (snowmelt periods, fall snow onset, spring transitions), and multi-year temporal coverage to comprehensively validate generalization capabilities and establish year-round operational readiness;
